{"caption":"The video captures a static outdoor row of potted plants set on interlocking paving stones beside a low concrete wall. From left to right, a dark grey pot holds a small tree, a terracotta pot supports a plant with red flowers, another grey pot contains a yellow-flowered shrub, a second terracotta pot carries a slender tree, and a partially visible dark pot sits at the far right.

The foliage of each plant sways gently and continuously throughout the view, while the pots, saucers, and background wall remain fixed within the frame. Their dark shadows stretch across the pavement and ripple as the leaves and branches move. The shadow of the red-flowered plant shifts in small irregular patterns, and the broader shadow of the yellow-flowered shrub changes shape and density. The right-hand tree casts a softer, fragmented silhouette that trembles continuously beside it on the paving stones.

The movement continues steadily across the entire view. The plants do not settle, and the surrounding scene shows no other visible change in any way.","length_note":""}
